    "created_at": "2015-07-28T08:18:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-07-28T08:18:53Z",
    "body": "I think that it would be best if the request triggered the observer.  I'm sure that there are other reasons, but off-the-cuff it would a) fit best with server push support, b) allow for observation of the entire exchange, and c) allow applications to implement logic that avoids redundant requests.\n\nWould a more concrete proposal help here?\n",
